# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the repo root's
# .dockerignore, which is what this file exists to sidestep. The root one
# carries `**/.next` — correct for upstream Supabase, and fatal here, because
# the whole point of our image is to copy apps/studio/.next/standalone. Docker
# reported it as:
#
#     failed to compute cache key: failed to calculate checksum of ref ...
#     > [3/3] COPY apps/studio/.next/standalone/ ./
#
# which reads like a corrupt layer cache rather than "that path is not in the
# context".
#
# Editing the root .dockerignore would work and would also conflict with every
# upstream merge, forever. This file is ours alone.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-include only the built output. The context is then
# ~775 MB of traced server rather than the whole 2.9 GB workspace.
*
!apps/studio/.next/standalone
